1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,840
In Mexico City, elderly women living alone were being found dead in their own homes. Many seem to have let their killer in.

2
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,580
They had opened the door themselves.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:23,920
The killings began in the late 1990s. By 2005, the city was in a panic. The press gave the killer a name: La Mataviejitas. The little old lady killer.

4
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:32,620
Investigators believed the killer posed as a government worker, offering pensions and welfare programs, to get through the door.

5
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:42,890
Witnesses described a tall, masculine-looking woman. Police decided they were hunting a man in disguise, and swept through the city's transgender community.

6
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:50,940
For a time, officials even dismissed talk of a serial killer as media sensationalism. The deaths kept coming.

7
00:00:50,960 --> 00:01:00,940
One lead went somewhere strange: several victims owned the same print of a painting, a boy in a red waistcoat. It was only a coincidence.

8
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,950
Police were looking for the wrong person.

9
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:14,500
On January 25, 2006, a woman was caught fleeing the home of an eighty-two-year-old victim, Ana María de los Reyes Alfaro.

10
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:24,310
Her name was Juana Barraza. Born in Hidalgo in 1957, she had survived a brutal childhood with an alcoholic mother.

11
00:01:24,330 --> 00:01:31,160
On weekends, she was a professional wrestler: La Dama del Silencio. The Lady of Silence.

12
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:40,530
Her fingerprints linked her to at least ten crime scenes. She admitted to four killings, and said her motive was resentment toward her own mother.

13
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:48,240
In 2008, she was convicted of sixteen murders and sentenced to 759 years.

14
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:57,060
Authorities linked her to as many as forty deaths. After her arrest, dozens of cases were simply closed… some of them never solved.

15
00:01:57,080 --> 00:02:04,637
The killer everyone was looking for… was the one nobody suspected. This is Plot Twist with A&R.

